{
  "title": "Arthrogryposis",
  "url": "https://www.orthobullets.com/pediatrics/4088/arthrogryposis",
  "subtitle": "Updated: Jan 4 2026",
  "sections": [
    {
      "text": "summary",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "-1",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Arthrogryposis is a non-progressive congenital disorder of unknown etiology that presents with multiple rigid joints leading to stiffness and severe limitation in motion in all 4 limbs.",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "-1",
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "text": "Diagnosis is made clinically with presence of concomitant elbow and knee hyperextension contractures, shoulder internal rotation contractures, hands with intrinsic plus deformity and severe limitation in range of motion of all 4 limbs. Genetic and enzyme testing can be helpful in supplementing diagnosis.",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "-1",
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "text": "Treatment is a multidisciplinary approach to address joint stiffness in all 4 limbs with a trial of bracing and casting followed by surgical soft tissue release or osteotomies as necessary.",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "-1",
          "children": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Epidemiology",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "-1",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Incidence",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "-1",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "1:3000 live births",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "-1",
              "children": []
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Etiology",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "-1",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Mechanism",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "-1",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "symmetry of contractures due to immobilization in utero",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "-1",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "neurogenic (90%)",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "-1",
                  "children": []
                },
                {
                  "text": "myopathic (10%)",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "-1",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pathophysiology",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "-1",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "exact mechanism unknown",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "-1",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "some mothers have serum antibodies inhibiting the fetal acetylcholine receptors leading to a decreased number of anterior horn cells",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "-1",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Associated conditions",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "-1",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "orthopaedic manifestations",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "-1",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "**upper extremity deformity**",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "-1",
                  "children": []
                },
                {
                  "text": "**teratologic hip subluxation and dislocation**",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "-1",
                  "children": []
                },
                {
                  "text": "**knee contractures**",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "-1",
                  "children": []
                },
                {
                  "text": "foot conditions",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "-1",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "**clubfoot**",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "**vertical talus**",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "text": "neuromuscular C-shaped scoliosis (33%)",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "-1",
                  "children": []
                },
                {
                  "text": "fractures (25%)",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "-1",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Prognosis",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "-1",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Nonambulatory (25%)",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "-1",
          "children": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Classification",
